# Powers of Ten: one look, from a child reaching up in a field out to the web of galaxies and home again, ten times further every second and a half. After Charles and Ray Eames's
# film of 1977. Each stretch of the way is a part of its own, at its own scale (the planets in kilometres, the stars in light years, the web in millions of them), the camera going
# at one steady pace (`planetfall ... straight`, `spacecam zoom ... steady`), with a dissolve where one scale hands on to the next. Written out by hand it would be a long file of
# sums: a line of the display (`hud`) names how far away we are.
# Two things are not to scale: the planets' orbits are drawn because the planets themselves would be too small to see, and the neighbouring galaxies are about three times too big, or they would be specks.
film    powers-of-ten
name    Powers of Ten
about   One look, from a child reaching up in a field out to the web of galaxies and home again, ten times further every second and a half.
tags    space, explainer
still   30

part "Up from the field"
scene   film_assets/wild/set.pbrt
terrain hills  size 3000  height 8  seed 4
sky     11:00 11:00  physical  altitude 100
mute    birds
forest  mixed 200  in -900 -900 900 900  near 1500
footing ground
cast    pip-child  at 0 0 0  facing 0
gesture pip-child  "cheer" 0 0.6 40 41
length  9.5
planetfall ocean  from 2  to 300000  at 1  over 8  clouds 0.45  straight
hud     "10 metres"  at -0.86 -0.84  size 0.04  from 2.08  to 3.63
hud     "100 metres"  at -0.86 -0.84  size 0.04  from 3.63  to 5.17
hud     "1 km"  at -0.86 -0.84  size 0.04  from 5.17  to 6.72
hud     "10 km"  at -0.86 -0.84  size 0.04  from 6.72  to 8.26
hud     "100 km"  at -0.86 -0.84  size 0.04  from 8.26  to 9.00
shot 0 Up
  descend

part "The Earth" dissolve 1
set     void
length  3.37
space   stars 1  milkyway 0.6  sun 60 12  bloom 0.08
planet  home  ocean  at 0 0 0  radius 6371  tilt 23  air 1  clouds 0.6
moon    moon  rocky  of home  radius 1737  orbit 384400  period 2000  phase 40
orbitline moon  colour 0.55 0.65 0.8  dashed
hud     "10,000 km"  at -0.86 -0.84  size 0.04  from 0.07  to 1.57
hud     "100,000 km"  at -0.86 -0.84  size 0.04  from 1.57  to 3.07
hud     "1 million km"  at -0.86 -0.84  size 0.04  from 3.07  to 3.37
shot 0 Out
  spacecam zoom  0 0 0  from 9000  to 1.6e+06  bearing 20  elevation 28  fov 40  steady

part "The planets" dissolve 1
set     void
length  3.45
space   stars 1  milkyway 0.6  sun off  bloom 0.1
star    sol  at 0 0 0  radius 696  kind sun  brightness 2
planet  hub  rocky  at 0 0 0  radius 1
moon    mercury  rocky   of hub  radius 2.4   orbit 58000    period 90    phase 20
moon    venus    desert  of hub  radius 6     orbit 108000   period 220   phase 100
moon    earth    ocean   of hub  radius 6.4   orbit 150000   period 365   phase 210
moon    mars     desert  of hub  radius 3.4   orbit 230000   period 690   phase 300
moon    jupiter  gas     of hub  radius 70    orbit 780000   period 4300  phase 70
moon    saturn   gas     of hub  radius 60    orbit 1400000  period 9000  phase 150
moon    uranus   gas     of hub  radius 25    orbit 2900000  period 30000 phase 250
moon    neptune  gas     of hub  radius 25    orbit 4500000  period 60000 phase 330
orbitline mercury  colour 0.5 0.55 0.7
orbitline venus    colour 0.5 0.55 0.7
orbitline earth    colour 0.5 0.8 1
orbitline mars     colour 0.5 0.55 0.7
orbitline jupiter  colour 0.5 0.55 0.7
orbitline saturn   colour 0.5 0.55 0.7
orbitline uranus   colour 0.5 0.55 0.7
orbitline neptune  colour 0.5 0.55 0.7
hud     "7 times Earth to Sun"  at -0.86 -0.84  size 0.04  from 0.78  to 2.28
hud     "67 times Earth to Sun"  at -0.86 -0.84  size 0.04  from 2.28  to 3.45
shot 0 Out
  spacecam zoom  0 0 0  from 300000  to 6e+07  bearing 20  elevation 28  fov 40  steady

