set     void
length  4.58
space   stars 0  milkyway 0.5  sun off  bloom 0.12
event   stars  at 0 0 0  size 600  count 16000
hud     "1 light year"  at -0.86 -0.84  size 0.04  from 0.18  to 1.68
hud     "10 light years"  at -0.86 -0.84  size 0.04  from 1.68  to 3.18
hud     "100 light years"  at -0.86 -0.84  size 0.04  from 3.18  to 4.58
